UID:ac544c6a78454190@role-estate-probate.maine-government-feeds
DTSTAMP:20260917T165717Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260917
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Secretary of State marks Constitution Day wit
 h unveiling of official printing of Maine Constitution
DESCRIPTION:First printing since 1876 includes redacted indigenous treaty 
 obligations\nAUGUSTA\, MAINE\n– Secretary of State Shenna Bellows marked
  Constitution Day by formally unveiling the official printing of the Maine
  Constitution\, the first formal printing since 1876. The unveiling took p
 lace at the Maine State Cultural Center in Augusta and included displays o
 f the original 1820 copy of the Maine State Constitution and the 1876 vers
 ion along with the new printing.\nFor more than a century\, Maine omitted 
 three original sections – Sections 1\, 2 and 5\, of Article X of the Con
 stitution – from official printed copies. The sections\, which remained 
 in full force despite the redaction\, include treaty obligations to the Wa
 banaki tribal nations. In 2023\, Mainers voted overwhelmingly to cancel th
 e 1876 amendment compelling the redaction and restore the language to prin
 ted copies of the constitution.\n“Restoring this language to the Maine C
 onstitution is a visible and lasting reminder of the important role the Wa
 banaki people played in the formation of Maine\,” said Secretary Bellows
 . “The Wabanaki have existed in Maine for 13\,000 years\, and voters mad
 e it clear that their immeasurable contributions to our collective past\, 
 present and future should be known\, acknowledged and celebrated\, not hid
 den from history.”\nThe large format version was printed using a 19th ce
 ntury letterpress onto vellum by Wolfe Editions of Portland and will be pe
 rmanently housed at the Maine State Archives along with the previous versi
 ons.\n###\nhttps://www.maine.gov/sos/news/secretary-state-marks-constituti
 on-day-unveiling-official-printing-maine-constitution
URL:https://www.maine.gov/sos/news/secretary-state-marks-constitution-day-
 unveiling-official-printing-maine-constitution
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
