 urces\n→\n	 \n			Primary Care Plus (PCPlus) Quality Webinar: Total Cost 
 Index (TCI)\nPrimary Care Plus (PCPlus) Quality Webinar: Total Cost Index 
 (TCI)\nSep 26\, 2026\nWe invite PCPlus providers to a quality webinar seri
 es that educates providers and administrators on best practices related to
  quality measures in the PCPlus program. This series helps practices optim
 ize their performance and payment while aligning with industry best practi
 ces for population and patient health. MaineCare PCPlus quality measures c
 an be found on the\nPCPlus website\n.\nJoin us on September 28\, 2026 from
  12:00-1:00 PM for our next webinar. We are partnering with The Cutler Ins
 titute to learn more about the TCI measure and review the measure’s spec
 ifications. More information on the TCI measure can be found on the\nHealt
 h Partners Website\n.\nPlease register\nin advance for this meeting. After
  registering\, you will receive a confirmation email with information abou
 t joining the meeting.\nFor questions about PCPlus\, please contact us at\
 nPCP-Network-Services.DHHS@maine.gov\n.\nhttps://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/pr
 oviders/provider-bulletins/primary-care-plus-pcplus-quality-webinar-total-
 cost-index-tci-2026-09-14
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/primary-ca
 re-plus-pcplus-quality-webinar-total-cost-index-tci-2026-09-14
